1
00:00:04,630 --> 00:00:05,780
¿Desfavorable?

2
00:00:05,960 --> 00:00:07,110
¿Por las ruedas?

3
00:00:07,340 --> 00:00:08,890
Vaya por Dios.

4
00:00:09,850 --> 00:00:11,010
