10
00:00:23,760 --> 00:00:24,190
¡Bingo!

11
00:00:24,230 --> 00:00:26,030
Dos por uno en ruedas.

12
00:00:28,960 --> 00:00:29,810
Buenas, he visto

13
00:00:29,850 --> 00:00:30,710
